msgstr "Tulipes per a l'equinocci de primavera. Edita la salutació."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:363
msgid "Sale"
msgstr "Rebaixes"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:365
msgid ""
"The Ledger with a promotional idle screen: a headline and an offer line you edit for each promotion."
msgstr ""
"El Ledger amb una pantalla d'espera promocional: un titular i una línia d'oferta que pots editar per a cada promoció."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:379
msgid "Black Friday"
msgstr "Black Friday"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:381
msgid ""
"Blackout with a deals ticker, and the offer line repeated on the order screens. Edit the offer."
msgstr ""
"Blackout amb una banda d'ofertes desplaçable i la línia de promoció repetida a les pantalles de comanda. Edita l'oferta."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:395
msgid "Detailed Receipt"
msgstr "Rebut detallat"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:397
msgid ""
"Extended info with SKU, unit price, full tax breakdown, customer address, and cashier details."
msgstr ""
"Informació ampliada amb SKU, preu unitari, desglossament complet d’impostos, adreça del client i dades del caixer."

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:410
msgid ""
"Items listed without prices. Includes gift message from customer note and return reference."
msgstr ""
"Articles llistats sense preus. Inclou el missatge de regal de la nota del client i la referència de devolució."

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:423
msgid ""
"Full-page A4/Letter invoice with bill-to/ship-to addresses, an itemised products table, and an optional \"How to pay\" panel (bank transfer + QR-encoded order-pay URL) shown when the order still needs payment."
msgstr ""
"Factura A4/Letter de pàgina completa amb adreces de facturació i enviament, una taula de productes detallada i un panell opcional \"Com pagar\" (transferència bancària + URL d’ordre de pagament codificada amb QR) que es mostra quan la comanda encara està pendent de pagament."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:434
msgid "Minimal / Modern"
msgstr "Minimal / Modern"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:436
msgid ""
"Compact receipt with a centered store header, bold double-border order band and dense item rows. Same essentials as Standard, less vertical space."
msgstr ""
"Rebut compacte amb capçalera de botiga centrada, banda de comanda de doble vora en negreta i files d’articles denses. Té l’essencial de l’estàndard, amb menys espai vertical."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:447
msgid "Narrow Receipt"
msgstr "Rebut estret"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:449
msgid ""
"Compact monospace receipt sized for narrow paper or HTML-capable thermal printers. Prints cleanly in black and white."
msgstr ""
"Rebut compacte en monospace, preparat per a paper estret o impressores tèrmiques compatibles amb HTML. S’imprimeix netament en blanc i negre."

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:461
msgid ""
"Fulfillment companion with items and quantities only. No pricing. Shipping address prominent."
msgstr ""
"Complement per a preparació amb només articles i quantitats. Sense preus. Amb l’adreça d’enviament en lloc destacat."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:472
msgid "Quote / Estimate"
msgstr "Pressupost / Estimació"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:474
msgid ""
"Pre-sale document with items and pricing. No payment section. Includes validity notice and terms."
msgstr ""
"Document previ a la venda amb articles i preus. Sense secció de pagament. Inclou avís de validesa i condicions."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:485
msgid "Standard Receipt"
msgstr "Rebut estàndard"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:487
msgid ""
"Streamlined receipt with logo, store info, itemized lines, totals and payment — covers what most stores need without the kitchen sink."
msgstr ""
"Rebut optimitzat amb logotip, informació de la botiga, línies d’articles, totals i pagament: cobreix el que necessiten la majoria de botigues sense complicacions innecessàries."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery. The (RTL) suffix marks right-to-left layout.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:498
msgid "Standard Receipt (RTL)"
msgstr "Rebut estàndard (RTL)"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:500
msgid ""
"Right-to-left version of the Standard Receipt for Arabic, Hebrew, Persian and Urdu sites. Mirrors layout and uses an RTL-friendly font stack."
msgstr ""
"Versió de dreta a esquerra del Rebut estàndard per a llocs en àrab, hebreu, persa i urdú. Reflecteix la maquetació i fa servir una pila de fonts adaptada a RTL."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:512
msgid "Detailed Thermal Receipt (58mm)"
msgstr "Rebut tèrmic detallat (58 mm)"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:514
msgid ""
"Kitchen-sink 58mm receipt: full customer + addresses, tax breakdown, refunds, payments, terms and order barcode."
msgstr ""
"Rebut de 58 mm amb tot inclòs: client complet + adreces, desglossament d’impostos, reemborsaments, pagaments, condicions i codi de barres de la comanda."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:525
msgid "Detailed Thermal Receipt (80mm)"
msgstr "Rebut tèrmic detallat (80 mm)"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:527
msgid ""
"Kitchen-sink 80mm receipt: full customer + addresses, tax breakdown, refunds, payments, terms and order barcode."
msgstr ""
"Rebut de 80 mm amb tot inclòs: client complet + adreces, desglossament d’impostos, reemborsaments, pagaments, condicions i codi de barres de la comanda."

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:540
msgid ""
"Order items only with large font, no pricing. Designed for kitchen display or prep stations."
msgstr ""
"Només articles de la comanda amb font gran, sense preus. Dissenyat per a pantalles de cuina o estacions de preparació."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:551
msgid "Simple Thermal Receipt (58mm)"
msgstr "Rebut tèrmic simple (58 mm)"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:553
msgid ""
"Clean, minimal thermal receipt for narrow 58mm paper. Same layout as 80mm, adjusted for 32-character width."
msgstr ""
"Rebut tèrmic net i minimalista per a paper estret de 58 mm. Mateixa disposició que el de 80 mm, ajustada a una amplada de 32 caràcters."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:564
msgid "Simple Thermal Receipt (80mm)"
msgstr "Rebut tèrmic simple (80 mm)"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:566
msgid ""
"Clean, minimal thermal receipt for standard 80mm paper. Store header, line items, totals, and barcode."
msgstr ""
"Rebut tèrmic net i minimalista per a paper estàndard de 80 mm. Capçalera de la botiga, articles, totals i codi de barres."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery. The (RTL) suffix marks right-to-left layout.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:577
msgid "Simple Thermal Receipt 80mm (RTL)"
msgstr "Rebut tèrmic simple 80 mm (RTL)"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery. CP864 / Windows-1256 are printer codepages; keep them verbatim.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:579
msgid ""
"Right-to-left thermal receipt for 80mm printers. Mirrors column alignments for Arabic, Hebrew, Persian and Urdu. Requires a printer that supports an Arabic codepage (CP864 or Windows-1256) — check your printer's manual before ordering."
msgstr ""
"Rebut tèrmic de dreta a esquerra per a impressores de 80 mm. Reflecteix l’alineació de les columnes per a l’àrab, l’hebreu, el persa i l’urdú. Cal una impressora que admeti una codepage àrab (CP864 o Windows-1256) — consulta el manual de la impressora abans de fer la comanda."

#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:591
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:613
msgid "A tabular report with groups, subtotals and totals."
msgstr "Informe en forma de taula amb grups, subtotals i totals."

#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:601
msgid "Report (Letterhead)"
msgstr "Informe amb paper amb capçalera"

#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:602
msgid ""
"A printed report on the store's letterhead with the scope, the generated time and page-safe tables."
msgstr ""
"Informe imprès amb el paper amb capçalera de la botiga, amb l’abast, l’hora de generació i taules preparades per imprimir-se en pàgines."

#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:612
msgid "Thermal Report"
msgstr "Informe tèrmic"

#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:623
msgid "Thermal Report (58mm)"
msgstr "Informe tèrmic (58 mm)"

#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:624
msgid ""
"A report for 58 mm paper: each row prints as a label line over its values."
msgstr ""
"Informe per a paper de 58 mm: cada fila s’imprimeix com una línia d’etiqueta damunt dels seus valors."

#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:635
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:657
msgid "Closure and X-report with tender counts, cash movements and totals."
msgstr ""
"Tancament i informe X amb recompte per mètode de pagament, moviments d'efectiu i totals."

#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:645
msgid "Closure (Detailed)"
msgstr "Tancament (detallat)"

#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:646
msgid ""
"The full closure with the denomination count and signature lines for the cashier and manager."
msgstr ""
"El tancament complet, amb el recompte de denominacions i línies de signatura per al caixer i el responsable."

#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:656
msgid "Thermal Closure"
msgstr "Tancament tèrmic"

#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:667
msgid "Thermal Closure (58mm)"
msgstr "Tancament tèrmic (58 mm)"

#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:668
msgid ""
"Closure and X-report for 58 mm paper. Tender, tax and payment tables stack as label lines over two-column rows."
msgstr ""
"Tancament i informe X per a paper de 58 mm. Les taules de mètodes de pagament, impostos i pagaments s’apilen en línies d’etiqueta damunt de files de dues columnes."

#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:678
msgid "Thermal Closure 80mm (RTL)"
msgstr "Tancament tèrmic de 80 mm (RTL)"

#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:679
msgid ""
"Closure and X-report for 80 mm paper, with mirrored columns for right-to-left scripts."
msgstr ""
"Tancament i informe X per a paper de 80 mm, amb les columnes invertides per a textos de dreta a esquerra."

#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:690
msgid "Count Slip (80mm)"
msgstr "Full de recompte (80 mm)"

#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:691
msgid ""
"The cashier's slip for the cash bag: float, counted tenders, denominations, movements, note and signature lines. No sales or tax figures."
msgstr ""
"Full del caixer per a la bossa de caixa: fons inicial, imports comptats, denominacions, moviments i línies per a notes i signatures. Sense xifres de vendes ni d’impostos."

